r K1 must be true, which requires gem = WHITE.\n\nFINAL: gem=WHITE; B1=T; W1=F; K1=T"}], "metadata": {"n_statements": 3, "gem_box": "WHITE", "relational_ratio": 0.539, "ast_prob": 0.354, "max_depth": 2}}
